# Unrestricted ledger (INV-NONEMPTY: `Unrestricted` is explicit and CI-gated). Checked by ci/unrestricted.py.
#
# One line per `unrestricted` occurrence in the EFFECTIVE form (`monban check-config <path> --print-effective`) of an
# in-tree config:
#   <config path relative to the repo root> <RFC 6901 JSON pointer into the effective form> <reason>
# The reason is free text (at least 20 characters, no TODO/TBD/FIXME): who needs everything, and why a capability
# list will not do. Entries that no longer match an occurrence fail the check (stale). The built-in default boot
# config (ci/fixtures/unrestricted/default-boot.json) can never be listed.
#
# No entries: no in-tree config grants `unrestricted`.
